  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "引言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f1c953727abfc1b",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Isaac GR00T（Generalist Robot 00 Technology，通用机器人 00 技术）是一个用于构建机器人基础模型和数据流水线的研发平台，旨在加速打造智能且适应性强的机器人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1775611eeeac0fc0",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们宣布推出 Isaac GR00T N1.5，这是 Isaac GR00T N1 的首次重大更新；后者是全球首个面向通用人形机器人推理与技能的开放基础模型。这一跨具身模型能够处理包括语言和图像在内的多模态输入，从而在多种环境中执行操作任务。通过后训练，该模型可以适配特定的机器人具身形态、任务和环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dba43a1f8d08aa87",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客中，我们将演示如何使用来自单台 SO-101 机械臂的遥操作数据，对 GR00T N1.5 进行后训练（微调）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bdda74b0de36019",
      "translationZh": "GR00T N1.5 技术博客：https://research.nvidia.com/labs/gear/gr00t-n1_5/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8992554e6cbe9049",
      "translationZh": "分步教程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd324f39fc4063f3",
      "translationZh": "如今，使用各种机器人形态的开发者都可以使用 GR00T N1.5，并能借助价格亲民的开源 LeRobot SO-101 机械臂，轻松对其进行微调和适配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f546be5b590bad9f",
      "translationZh": "这种灵活性由 EmbodimentTag 系统实现，该系统支持针对不同机器人平台无缝定制模型，让爱好者、研究人员和工程师能够根据自己的硬件，定制先进的人形机器人推理与操作能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b37313563ee95468",
      "translationZh": "步骤 0：安装",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b4bac5625604e0a",
      "translationZh": "在开始安装之前，请检查你是否满足先决条件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3c9bd119d5bc1923",
      "translationZh": "0.1 克隆 Isaac-GR00T 仓库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "694d4cccb4695722",
      "translationZh": "0.2 创建环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "070a9814f4628dbc",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：数据集准备",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "735277e36acc79a6",
      "translationZh": "用户可以使用任何 LeRobot 数据集对 GROOT N1.5 进行微调。在本教程中，我们将以桌面清理任务为例进行微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "818de88efbf480eb",
      "translationZh": "需要注意的是，GR00T N1.5 的初始预训练未包含 SO-100 或 SO-101 的数据集。因此，我们将以 new_embodiment 的形式对其进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89e850052de6286e",
      "translationZh": "1.1 创建或下载你的数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b1f6dcf8f33a364",
      "translationZh": "在本教程中，你可以按照这些说明创建自己的自定义数据集（推荐），也可以从 Hugging Face 下载 so101-table-cleanup 数据集。--local-dir 参数指定数据集在你机器上的保存位置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "737d64ba9afa9652",
      "translationZh": "1.2 配置模态文件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "295a0802991119c1",
      "translationZh": "modality.json 文件提供有关状态模态和动作模态的补充信息，使数据集“兼容 GR00T”。使用以下命令，将 getting_started/examples/so100_dualcam__modality.json 复制到数据集的 <DATASET_PATH>/meta/modality.json：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c754a90e5063dec6",
      "translationZh": "注意：对于 so100_strawberry_grape 这样的单摄像头配置，请运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e2e4e4a2df7d6f8",
      "translationZh": "完成这些步骤后，就可以使用 GR00T 的 LeRobotSingleDataset 类加载数据集。此处展示了一个加载数据集的示例脚本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a24d66557522983a",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：微调模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3a120b0263f5ff9",
      "translationZh": "可以使用 Python 脚本 scripts/gr00t_finetune.py 对 GR00T N1.5 进行微调。要开始微调，请在终端中执行以下命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17f6aaf5c54576c8",
      "translationZh": "提示：默认微调设置需要约 25G 显存。如果你的显存不足，可以尝试为 gr00t_finetune.py 脚本添加 --no-tune_diffusion_model 标志。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e4a587aa2f30a459",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：开环评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38aa279fbd823d62",
      "translationZh": "训练完成并生成微调后的策略后，你可以运行以下命令，在开环设置下以可视化方式查看其表现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1b795860156992d",
      "translationZh": "恭喜！你已成功针对一种新的机器人形态微调了 GR00T-N1.5。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fd1eb00d229bfccf",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92fb8d0ae5d6780e",
      "translationZh": "成功完成策略微调和评估后，最后一步是将其部署到实体机器人上，以便在现实世界中执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0eb3a57c0bf66671",
      "translationZh": "要连接你的 SO-101 机器人并开始评估，请在终端中执行以下命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "122545b2beec7600",
      "translationZh": "首先，将策略作为服务器运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95abdf1c816ca541",
      "translationZh": "在另一个终端中，将评估脚本作为客户端运行。请务必根据你的配置，更新机器人的端口和 id，以及摄像头的索引和参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83501ca11bd7614d",
      "translationZh": "由于我们使用不同的语言指令对 GRO0T-N1.5 进行了微调，用户可以使用数据集中的某个任务提示来引导策略，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcb7076b985be085",
      "translationZh": "“抓取胶带并放入笔筒”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7bfb346eb14071b",
      "translationZh": "详细的分步教程请参阅：https://github.com/NVIDIA/Isaac-GR00T/tree/main/getting_started",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f2a7eb42672afa90",
      "translationZh": "🎉 祝你动手探索愉快！💻🛠️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c4756410b23b9cb3",
      "translationZh": "即刻开始",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fc260ac661160e6",
      "translationZh": "准备好使用 NVIDIA 的 GR00T N1.5 提升你的机器人项目了吗？通过以下必备资源开始探索：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb23e4b3bc719e0c",
      "translationZh": "GR00T N1.5 模型：直接从 Hugging Face 下载最新模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "427ccbb66a07839d",
      "translationZh": "微调资源：在我们的 GitHub 上查找用于微调的示例数据集和 PyTorch 脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ea9e79436a07dae3",
      "translationZh": "贡献数据集：向 Hugging Face 贡献你自己的数据集，为机器人技术社区赋能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0df9df9d190aec58",
      "translationZh": "LeRobot 黑客松：加入全球社区，参与即将举行的 LeRobot 黑客松，运用你的技能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53f6f319bf3b1201",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face 上关注 NVIDIA，及时了解最新进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
